@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041

### 1. Add a valid pH reading
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bioreactors/BR-01/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Ph", "value": 7.1 }

### 2. Add another valid pH reading
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bioreactors/BR-01/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Ph", "value": 6.9 }

### 3. Add an invalid reading (should be rejected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bioreactors/BR-01/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Ph", "value": 9.5 }

### 4. Get all readings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bioreactors/BR-01/readings

### 5. Get the pH summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bioreactors/BR-01/readings/summary?type=Ph

### 6. Summary for a bioreactor with no data (should be 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bioreactors/BR-99/readings/summary?type=Ph